# ESG > Social > Employee Satisfaction: Employee Satisfaction and Engagement

## Employee Satisfaction and Engagement

In order to ensure that sound working practices are implemented within the Company, and to assess the appropriateness and comprehensiveness of the implementation of programmes supporting employee welfare, BKI conducts an employee satisfaction and engagement survey as a form of feedback from employees to the Company. The satisfaction and engagement survey is required to be completed by all BKI employees on an annual basis. The satisfaction survey assesses the level of employees' satisfaction in working and contributing as part of BKI, while the engagement survey assesses how engaged an employee is with respect to their duties and work, their colleagues, and the identity of BKI.

The satisfaction and engagement survey is conducted with regard to parameters such as:

1. Relationship with Direct Supervisor;
2. Collaboration and Cooperation;
3. Performance Management;
4. Talent Management and Development;
5. Employee Welfare and Recognition;
6. Customer-First Culture;
7. Empowerment;
8. Goals and Objectives;
9. Operational Efficiency;
10. Integrity and Social Responsibility;
11. Remuneration and Benefits; and
12. Change Management.

Employee satisfaction levels at BKI throughout 2022–2025 consistently met the predetermined target scores, with a relatively stable trend maintained at a favourable level. This indicates that BKI employees are satisfied with the working environment, relationships among colleagues, and the self-development opportunities provided by the Company.

| **Description** | **2025** | **2024** | **2023** | **2022** |
|---|---|---|---|---|

| Actual Satisfaction Score (%) | 81.99% | 83.94% | 79.57% | 80.04% |

| Target Score (%) | 81% | 81% | 79% | 75% |

| Percentage of BKI Employees Responding (%) | 100% | 100% | 100% | 100% |

Throughout the 2022–2025 period, the employee engagement level at BKI has consistently met the predetermined target score and has increased year on year, indicating that BKI employees feel involved, enthusiastic, and committed in carrying out their day-to-day operational activities within the BKI environment.

| **Description** | **2025** | **2024** | **2023** | **2022** |
|---|---|---|---|---|

| Actual Engagement Score (%) | 82.90% | 84.65% | 80.48% | 81.09% |

| Target Score (%) | 81% | 81% | 79% | 75% |

| Percentage of BKI Employees Responding (%) | 100% | 100% | 100% | 100% |

# Our Policy Page

### VISI

Menjadi grup pemastian terpadu Indonesia yang bertaraf global, berkelas dunia, inovatif, terpercaya, dan menciptakan nilai bagi para stakeholder.

### MISI

Memberikan nilai tambah kepada pemangku kepentingan melalui pemastian kesesuaian standar mutu, serta peningkatan efisiensi, keselamatan dan keamanan;

Menyediakan jasa yang komprehensif dan terpercaya dengan memperkuat kapasitas dan kapabilitas terkait sumber daya manusia, teknologi dan inovasi melalui sinergi dan integrasi bisnis;

Memperluas jaringan dan memperkuat reputasi di tingkat global dalam rangka mendukung visi Indonesia Emas 2045.

### KEBIJAKAN KESELAMATAN, KESEHATAN KERJA DAN LINGKUNGAN

Sebagai upaya dalam mengutamakan Keselamatan dan Kesehatan Kerja dan Lingkungan serta untuk memberi pengaruh positif terhadap performa keselamatan di perusahaan, BKI berkomitmen untuk:

Menyediakan layanan berkualitas dengan memprioritaskan keselamatan dan kesehatan kerja serta lingkungan yang memenuhi standar nasional dan internasional, peraturan, dan regulasi yang berlaku;

Mencegah pencemaran lingkungan yang berhubungan dengan proses dan aktivitas pekerjaan dibawah kendali BKI serta membuat kerangka kerja untuk mendefinisikan, memonitor, dan mengevaluasi kebijakan, tujuan dan sasaran keselamatan, kesehatan kerja dan lingkungan;

Memenuhi dan mematuhi persyaratan undang-undang, peraturan, dan ketentuan yang berlaku;

Mengidentifikasi, menilai, dan mengendalikan risiko serta menata lingkungan kerja guna mencegah kecelakaan dan penyakit akibat kerja;

Menyediakan dan memelihara kondisi lingkungan kerja yang aman dan sehat dengan tujuan untuk pencegahan kecelakaan kerja serta untuk meningkatkan produktivitas kerja;

Memastikan adanya konsultasi dan partisipasi aktif serta mempromosikan kesadaran di antara seluruh pegawai dan stakeholder dalam hal penerapan perilaku kerja yang aman;

Melakukan perbaikan berkelanjutan terhadap Sistem Manajemen Keselamatan dan Kesehatan Kerja (SMK3) serta sistem pengelolaan lingkungan.

